  "Instead of creating a complete native Android application, users can build interfaces with HTML, CSS and JavaScript and run them directly inside SoifGo through an integrated WebView bridge.": "Badala ya kuunda programu kamili ya asili ya Android, watumiaji wanaweza kujenga violesura kwa HTML, CSS na JavaScript na kuziendesha moja kwa moja ndani ya SoifGo kupitia daraja jumuishi la WebView.",
