  "Yes. You describe the idea to an AI assistant and the AI writes the code. You paste it into SoifGo and tell the AI if something does not look right. No programming knowledge is needed, but you do follow a short setup guide the first time.": "Ndio. Unaeleza wazo kwa msaidizi wa AI na AI anaandika msimbo. Unabandika kwenye SoifGo na kumwambia AI ikiwa kitu hakionekani sawa. Ujuzi wa programu hauhitajiki, lakini unafuata mwongozo mfupi wa usanidi mara ya kwanza.",
  "Does SoifGo turn my idea into a separate APK or Google Play app?": "Je, SoifGo inabadilisha wazo langu kuwa APK tofauti au programu ya Google Play?",
