  "Why use SoifGo instead of opening the HTML file in a browser?": "Kwa nini utumie SoifGo badala ya kufungua faili ya HTML kwenye kivinjari?",
  "A browser can open many simple pages. SoifGo adds a place to keep your ideas as buttons in folders and pages, and gives your page ready-made calls for Bluetooth serial modules (HC-05, HC-06), MQTT, HTTP and phone sensors, and supports the microphone and speech recognition through the standard browser request. Browsers can reach some of these only with limits or extra setup, and generally not classic Bluetooth serial modules.": "Kivinjari kinaweza kufungua kurasa nyingi rahisi. SoifGo inaongeza mahali pa kuweka mawazo yako kama vitufe katika folda na kurasa, na inatoa ukurasa wako simu zilizotengenezwa tayari kwa moduli za Bluetooth za mfululizo (HC-05, HC-06), MQTT, HTTP na sensorer za simu, na inasaidia maikrofoni na utambuzi wa usemi kupitia ombi la kawaida la kivinjari. Vivinjari vinaweza kufikia baadhi ya haya tu kwa mipaka au usanidi wa ziada, na kwa ujumla sio moduli za kawaida za Bluetooth za mfululizo.",
  "Is SoifGo on Google Play?": "Je, SoifGo iko kwenye Google Play?",
  "No. SoifGo is not on Google Play. Download it from APKPure or the ZIP in the": "Hapana. SoifGo haiko kwenye Google Play. Ipakue kutoka APKPure au ZIP iliyo katika sehemu ya",
  "section. Android asks you to allow installs from unknown sources for the app you use to open the file. The VirusTotal report is linked there.": "sehemu. Android inakuuliza uruhusu usakinishaji kutoka vyanzo visivyojulikana kwa programu unayotumia kufungua faili. Ripoti ya VirusTotal imeunganishwa hapo.",
  "Which AI assistants work with SoifGo?": "Wasaidizi gani wa AI wanafanya kazi na SoifGo?",
  "Any assistant that can write a single HTML file should work, though quality varies. Give it the address": "Msaidizi yeyote anayeweza kuandika faili moja ya HTML anapaswa kufanya kazi, ingawa ubora unatofautiana. Mpe anwani",
  "so it uses the real SoifGo function names. If it cannot open links, paste the text of that file or of the": "ili itumie majina halisi ya kazi za SoifGo. Ikiwa haiwezi kufungua viungo, bandika maandishi ya faili hiyo au ya sehemu ya",
  "section.": ".",
  "Is SoifGo free?": "Je, SoifGo ni bure?",
  "Yes, SoifGo is completely free. No hidden fees or in-app purchases.": "Ndio, SoifGo ni bure kabisa. Hakuna ada zilizofichwa au ununuzi wa ndani ya programu.",
  "Does SoifGo work offline?": "Je, SoifGo inafanya kazi nje ya mtandao?",
  "Yes. Bluetooth and phone-sensor features work completely offline. Only MQTT and HTTP require an internet connection.": "Ndio. Vipengele vya Bluetooth na sensorer za simu hufanya kazi kabisa nje ya mtandao. Ni MQTT na HTTP pekee vinavyohitaji muunganisho wa mtandao.",
  "Which hardware does SoifGo support?": "SoifGo inasaidia vifaa gani?",
  "Any device using Bluetooth SPP (HC-05, HC-06), MQTT, or HTTP REST APIs. This includes Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, and more.": "Kifaa chochote kinachotumia Bluetooth SPP (HC-05, HC-06), MQTT, au API za HTTP REST. Hii inajumuisha Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, na zaidi.",
  "What can I actually do inside the WebView?": "Ninaweza kufanya nini hasa ndani ya WebView?",
  "You can send and receive Bluetooth data, read phone sensors (light, motion, magnetometer), use the microphone and speech recognition in more languages, connect to MQTT brokers, call HTTP APIs, store data with": "Unaweza kutuma na kupokea data ya Bluetooth, kusoma sensorer za simu (mwanga, mwendo, magnetometer), kutumia maikrofoni na utambuzi wa usemi katika lugha zaidi, kuungana na broker wa MQTT, kupiga simu API za HTTP, kuhifadhi data na",
  ", and use native": ", na utumie",
  "dialogs. On top of that, the WebView itself is a full modern browser engine — so Canvas 2D, WebGL 3D, SVG, Web Audio, Gamepad, Web Workers, and any JavaScript library (Chart.js, Three.js, D3.js, TensorFlow.js…) all work out of the box.": "dialogi asili. Zaidi ya hayo, WebView yenyewe ni injini kamili ya kivinjari cha kisasa — kwa hivyo Canvas 2D, WebGL 3D, SVG, Web Audio, Gamepad, Web Workers, na maktaba yoyote ya JavaScript (Chart.js, Three.js, D3.js, TensorFlow.js…) zote hufanya kazi mara moja.",
  "Is SoifGo safe to install?": "Je, ni salama kusakinisha SoifGo?",
  "Yes. The APK has been scanned by": "Ndio. APK imepimwa na",
  "antivirus engines": "injini za antivirus",
  "on VirusTotal with zero threats detected.": "kwenye VirusTotal bila vitisho vyovyote vilivyogunduliwa.",
  "View the report": "Tazama ripoti",
  "How do I get started with SoifGo?": "Ninaanzaje na SoifGo?",
  "Download the app, open the": "Pakua programu, fungua",
  ", and follow the step-by-step tutorials. No programming knowledge is required for basic use.": ", na ufuate mafunzo ya hatua kwa hatua. Ujuzi wa programu hauhitajiki kwa matumizi ya kawaida.",
  "Are there ready-to-use examples?": "Je, kuna mifano tayari kutumika?",
  "Yes. The": "Ndio.",
  "example shows how to control two DC motors independently over Bluetooth, using a TDA7073A motor driver and software PWM on an Arduino Uno. For the full bridge API, see the": "mfano unaonyesha jinsi ya kudhibiti motors mbili za DC kwa kujitegemea kupitia Bluetooth, ukitumia dereva wa motor TDA7073A na PWM ya programu kwenye Arduino Uno. Kwa API kamili ya daraja, tazama",
  "guide.": "mwongozo.",
  "Where can I ask questions or report issues?": "Ninaweza kuuliza maswali au kuripoti matatizo wapi?",
  "You can contact support at": "Unaweza kuwasiliana na msaada kwa",
  "SoifGo bridge reference for AI assistants": "Marejeleo ya daraja la SoifGo kwa wasaidizi wa AI",
  "The SoifGo bridge names cannot be guessed. Only the Sub names listed in the table below exist. Never invent or guess a name. Sending over Bluetooth is done with": "Majina ya daraja la SoifGo hayawezi kukisiwa. Ni majina ya Sub yaliyoorodheshwa kwenye jedwali hapa chini pekee yaliyopo. Kamwe usibuni au kukisia jina. Kutuma kupitia Bluetooth hufanywa na",
  "Wrong Sub = automatic warning.": "Sub isiyofaa = onyo la kiotomatiki.",
  "If a page calls a Sub that does not belong to SoifGo, SoifGo detects it, shows a warning with a sound, and copies the list of correct Subs to the clipboard. The user can paste that list into the AI assistant. The AI must treat it as the source of truth and fix the code to match it exactly.": "Ikiwa ukurasa unaita Sub isiyo ya SoifGo, SoifGo inaitambua, inaonyesha onyo na sauti, na kunakili orodha ya Subs sahihi kwenye ubao wa kunakili. Mtumiaji anaweza kubandika orodha hiyo kwenye msaidizi wa AI. AI lazima ichukulie kama chanzo cha ukweli na kurekebisha msimbo ili ufanane nayo haswa.",
  "The microphone has no Sub.": "Maikrofoni haina Sub.",
  "Do not call": "Usiite",
  "for it. The page makes the standard browser microphone request (for example by starting speech recognition). SoifGo detects that request and shows the user one prompt to allow the microphone. The prompt appears only once; later requests still run in the code, but nothing is asked again.": "kwa ajili yake. Ukurasa hufanya ombi la kawaida la maikrofoni la kivinjari (kwa mfano kwa kuanzisha utambuzi wa usemi). SoifGo inatambua ombi hilo na kuonyesha mtumiaji kidokezo kimoja cha kuruhusu maikrofoni. Kidokezo kinaonekana mara moja tu; maombi ya baadaye bado yanaendesha kwenye msimbo, lakini hakuna kinachoulizwa tena.",
  "The one call shape (3 rules)": "Umbo moja la simu (sheria 3)",
  "The first argument is the Sub name, copied exactly from the table below.": "Hoja ya kwanza ni jina la Sub, lililonakiliwa haswa kutoka kwenye jedwali hapa chini.",
