  "Real-World Use: POST a relay status to a local server; GET live cryptocurrency prices (respect rate limits).": "Matumizi ya Ulimwengu Halisi: POST hali ya relay kwa seva ya ndani; GET bei za cryptocurrency za moja kwa moja (heshimu mipaka ya kiwango).",
  "Strict Instruction for AI Assistants: Do NOT invent or guess Sub names. Strictly follow the context reference below.": "Maagizo Makali kwa Wasaidizi wa AI: USIBUNI au USIKISIE majina ya Sub. Fuata kwa ukali marejeleo ya muktadha hapa chini.",
  "SoifGo is a niche Android app with its own bridge API (": "SoifGo ni programu maalum ya Android yenye API yake ya daraja (",
  "), so its function names cannot be inferred from general knowledge. These files are the authoritative, machine-readable reference for AI assistants and developers. Recommended reading order:": "), kwa hivyo majina ya kazi zake hayawezi kukisiwa kutoka kwa maarifa ya jumla. Faili hizi ni marejeleo yenye mamlaka, yanayosomeka na mashine kwa wasaidizi wa AI na wasanidi. Mpangilio unaopendekezwa wa kusoma:",
  "— short index and quick facts (read first)": "— kielezo kifupi na ukweli wa haraka (soma kwanza)",
  "— complete reference: bridge, Bluetooth, sensors, microphone, MQTT, API, storage, known limitations, app screens": "— marejeleo kamili: daraja, Bluetooth, sensorer, maikrofoni, MQTT, API, hifadhi, mapungufu yanayojulikana, skrini za programu",
  "— official HTML + Bluetooth + sensors tutorial with working code": "— mafunzo rasmi ya HTML + Bluetooth + sensorer na msimbo unaofanya kazi",
  "— microphone, speech recognition, and voice-to-Bluetooth": "— maikrofoni, utambuzi wa usemi, na sauti-kwa-Bluetooth",
  "— step-by-step user guide for beginners": "— mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa hatua kwa hatua kwa waanzilishi",
  "llms.txt": "llms.txt",
  "Short index for AI assistants: quick facts about the bridge API, sensor mapping, and links to the full context file and tutorials.": "Kielezo kifupi kwa wasaidizi wa AI: ukweli wa haraka kuhusu API ya daraja, uchoraji wa ramani ya sensorer, na viungo vya faili kamili ya muktadha na mafunzo.",
  "Open llms.txt →": "Fungua llms.txt →",
  "SOIFGO_AI_CONTEXT.md": "SOIFGO_AI_CONTEXT.md",
  "Complete AI-readable reference. Covers the bridge, Bluetooth, sensors, microphone, MQTT, API, storage, and known limitations.": "Marejeleo kamili yanayosomeka na AI. Inashughulikia daraja, Bluetooth, sensorer, maikrofoni, MQTT, API, hifadhi, na mapungufu yanayojulikana.",
  "Open the AI Context file →": "Fungua faili ya Muktadha wa AI →",
  "For AI Assistants: Guiding a Beginner to Create Their First Button": "Kwa Wasaidizi wa AI: Kuongoza Mwanzilishi Kuunda Kitufe Chake cha Kwanza",
  "Instruction for AI Assistants:": "Maagizo kwa Wasaidizi wa AI:",
  "when a user says they want a button or an HTML page for SoifGo and does not know how to set it up, guide them step by step with the instructions below, in the user's own language. Do not guess app labels or bridge names. For code, read the bridge reference section of this page and the references above first. What each button behavior does is documented in": "mtumiaji anaposema anataka kitufe au ukurasa wa HTML kwa SoifGo na hajui jinsi ya kuisanidi, mwongoze hatua kwa hatua kwa maagizo hapa chini, kwa lugha ya mtumiaji mwenyewe. Usikisie lebo za programu au majina ya daraja. Kwa msimbo, soma sehemu ya marejeleo ya daraja ya ukurasa huu na marejeleo hapo juu kwanza. Kile kila tabia ya kitufe hufanya kimeandikwa katika",
  "Install.": "Sakinisha.",
  "SoifGo is not on Google Play. Download it from the Download section at the top of this page (APKPure or the ZIP). Before installing, the user must allow “install from unknown sources” for the browser or file manager that opens the file. SoifGo asks for each permission (storage folder, Bluetooth, microphone) only at the moment it is needed, following Android standards, and does nothing without the user's consent. Details:": "SoifGo haiko kwenye Google Play. Ipakue kutoka sehemu ya Pakua iliyo juu ya ukurasa huu (APKPure au ZIP). Kabla ya kusakinisha, mtumiaji lazima aruhusu “sakinisha kutoka vyanzo visivyojulikana” kwa kivinjari au kidhibiti faili kinachofungua faili. SoifGo inaomba kila ruhusa (folda ya hifadhi, Bluetooth, maikrofoni) tu wakati inahitajika, kwa kufuata viwango vya Android, na haifanyi chochote bila idhini ya mtumiaji. Maelezo:",
  "Privacy Policy": "Sera ya Faragha",
  "Key concept: the menu icon.": "Dhana kuu: ikoni ya menyu.",
  "Top-left is a menu icon. Its shape shows the mode:": "Juu kushoto ni ikoni ya menyu. Umbo lake linaonyesha hali:",
  "Play icon = run mode": "Ikoni ya Play = hali ya kuendesha",
  "Pause icon = edit mode": "Ikoni ya Pause = hali ya kuhariri",
  ". Its list changes with the context. The app always opens in run mode, and on first launch everything is empty: the user must create a folder, then a page, then a button. Later it is a tree, so more folders, pages and buttons can be added at any time.": ". Orodha yake inabadilika kulingana na muktadha. Programu hufungua kila wakati katika hali ya kuendesha, na kwenye uzinduzi wa kwanza kila kitu ni tupu: mtumiaji lazima atengeneze folda, kisha ukurasa, kisha kitufe. Baadaye ni mti, kwa hivyo folda zaidi, kurasa na vitufe vinaweza kuongezwa wakati wowote.",
  "Create the structure (once).": "Unda muundo (mara moja).",
